    "title": "Color Phone Call Screen Theme",
    "description": "<b>Color Phone Call Screen Theme App</b> is a personalized call screen for incoming calls with color phone screen. Make your call theme unique with color call theme, live wallpapers, cool call flash effects, ringtone,....\r\n\r\n<b>\u2728Color Phone features: Call screen themes?\u2728</b>\r\n\ud83d\udd25 10.000+ themes available for free with many different styles\r\n\ud83d\udd25 22+ call screen themes including: Anime, Neon, Galaxy, Love, Hero, et\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Theme options for each incoming call separately\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Optional incoming call screen themes with videos, images and gifs available\r\n\ud83d\udd25 50+ exciting new call button animation sets\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Animated incoming call screen color effect\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Preview call screen themes live with call screen\r\n\r\n<b>\u2728TOP FEATURES FOR COLOR PHONE CALL SCREEN THEME\u2728</b>\r\n<b><i>\ud83c\udf08Colorful Call Theme</i></b>\r\nEndless phone call screen theme - color phone style such as love themes\ud83d\udc96, nature themes\ud83c\udf33, cute themes (anime, naruto), animal\ud83d\udc31, neon, car, universe, landscape and many dynamic caller screen themes are made for you. \r\n\u2022 Unique color phone call button styles with dynamic call answer button, stylish calling icons.\r\n\u2022 Avatar maker/funny memes, animations and color phone call screen background, font awesome.\r\n\u2022 Unique dialer button themes for call keypad.\r\n\r\n<b><i>\ud83c\udfb5Call Ringtone Maker</i></b>\r\nColor Phone Call Screen Theme App custom free ringtone songs to your personal taste for different contacts or groups by extracting the best part of your audio song from a custom gallery video file/music player and set caller tune. Set caller tune music for lover or best friends and family.\r\n\r\n<b><i>\ud83d\udd14LED Flash Alert </i></b>\r\nBlinking call flashlight with vibration to remind for all incoming calls\ud83c\udf1f Color Phone Call Screen Theme help you answer any call quickly and avoid missing any important incoming calls or your phone call theme is on silent mode or in a dark environment with flash alert on incoming calls.\r\n\r\n<b><i>\u26a1EDGE Lighting Calling</i></b>\r\nStunning edge lighting display for call notification with 3d theme, Neon lights and Neon LED lights.\r\n\r\n<b><i>\ud83d\udd0eCaller ID Photo</i></b>\r\nCaller photo full screen: Identify who is calling you with an unknown call - Recognize the caller and make your phone call theme stand out.\r\n\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#a32345\">How to use:</font>\r\n\u2022 Choose your preferred phone call themes directly from the app.\r\n\u2022 Assign the selected phone call theme to a single contact or multiple contacts.\r\n\u2022 Personalize further by adding your own call wallpapers from your gallery.\r\nAnd now, you are ready to see the new incoming call theme with the most Stylish Call Theme - Color Phone Call Screen Theme App.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8cThank you for choosing our app. Contact us: teammarketing@lutech.ltd",
